	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_3">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『もっと　はげしく
ぶつかってきて　ください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T07:08:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T07:08:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『もっと　激しく
ぶつかってきて　ください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T07:08:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
